	(text_box "=== REFERENCE DOCUMENTS USED THROUGHOUT ===\nREFERENCE DOCUMENTS USED THROUGHOUT:\nFPGA CORE\n- ECP5 and ECP5-5G Family Datasheet - FPGA-DS-02012\n- ECP5 sysI/O Usage Guide - FPGA-TN-02032\n- ECP5 Power Decoupling and Bypass Filtering App Note - FPGA-TN-02115\n- ECP5 sysCONFIG Usage Guide (TN1260) - boot mode strapping, pull-up\n  requirements, SPI flash programming\n- ECP5 Programming and Configuration Usage Guide - FPGA-TN-02050\n- ECP5 Package Diagrams (mechanical/ball pitch/diameter) - FPGA-DS-02053\n- ECP5 Pin Migration (caBGA381) - pin-level ball/bank/differential data\n- Lattice Answer Database #738 - unused I/O pin handling\n\nPER-COMPONENT DATASHEETS\n- TLV62569 (switching regulator) - design equations, Table 4 (L/C matrix)\n- MAX11120-MAX11128 (ADC family) - MAX11125 specifics, SWCNV mode\n- IS25LP128 (SPI flash)\n- IS42S16160J / MT48LC16M16A2 (SDRAM)\n- FT231XS (USB-to-UART bridge) - pin functions, CBUS defaults\n- PCA9306D (I2C level shifter) - DDC/EDID voltage translation\n- BZT52C3V6 (zener diode) - HPD clamp\n- OV7670 (camera sensor) - XCLK requirement, DVP timing\n- CUI SJ-43516-SMT-TR (audio/video jack) - pinout\n\nSTANDARDS\n- RS-170A / SMPTE 170M (composite video) - 75 ohm load impedance origin\n- USB Type-C spec - CC1/CC2 pulldown convention for legacy device mode\n\n\n=== CHANGES SINCE v1.0 ===\nCHANGES SINCE v1.0:\n- Bank 7 VCCIO documented as selectable 2.5V / 3.3V (was listed as 3.3V).\n- Bank 8 VCCIO documented as 3.3V (was blank).\n- Bank 6 description corrected (USB-UART, not JTAG).\n- Added PCB design rules box (stackup, impedance targets, layer rules).\n- Added note on true LVDS requirements for GPIO +/- pairs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
